Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.30,0:00:07.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.26,0:00:11.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,This speechless young girl's\Nname is Kukrushka.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.05,0:00:15.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,No one has ever heard Kukrushka's voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.34,0:00:17.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Kukrushka?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:23.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But the fact that she does not speak\Nis actually part of her beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.39,0:00:25.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,An ancient sage once spake thusly:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:29.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,"The ideal woman is one who does not speak."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.59,0:00:32.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}More new crewmates...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.80,0:00:35.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just how many more are there going to be?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:41.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But a young girl is a fleeting miracle,\Nsoon swept away by the winds of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.01,0:00:48.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,She burns far too brightly\Nfor a middle-aged man like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.30,0:00:52.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Will you pity me? Will you pity Jonas?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:54.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Jonas...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.05,0:00:59.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The meeting to determine how to handle{\i0}\N{\i1}the Gnosia infestation will commence shortly.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.47,0:01:03.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All crew should gather{\i0}\N{\i1}in the main control room.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.68,0:01:08.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Though it pains me,\Nit seems we have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.76,0:01:11.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Let us make our way there, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.59,0:03:02.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There are so many...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.80,0:03:09.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The evacuation orders were swift, so we\Nwere able to save a good number of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.80,0:03:14.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But apparently quite a few Gnosia\Ninfectees got on board, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.26,0:03:18.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Well, let's begin the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.89,0:03:28.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,According to LeVi, there are unfortunately\Nthree Gnosia among the twelve on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.47,0:03:34.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Thus begins the banquet of madness...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.39,0:03:36.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,How shall we deal with this situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.80,0:03:37.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,How indeed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.09,0:03:44.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,To go with the proverbial flow, like a leaf\Non a rushing river... That, too, is an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.39,0:03:47.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So you're saying that as captain,\Nyou intend to do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.80,0:03:49.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.18,0:03:50.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Did I say something strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.89,0:03:53.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You're the captain of this ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.89,0:03:54.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.39,0:03:58.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It seems your amnesia is the genuine article.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.59,0:04:01.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Then allow me to introduce myself once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.39,0:04:05.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yuri, I bid thee welcome\Nto the Interstellar Cruiser D.Q.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.26,0:04:10.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,As the captain of this ship, I, Jonas,\Nam pleased to make your acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.05,0:04:14.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Now, let the banquet continue!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.97,0:04:16.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You may do as you please, Stella.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.05,0:04:18.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.51,0:04:20.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The way they're talking to each other...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.43,0:04:22.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Does Stella follow Jonas's commands?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.22,0:04:24.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.09,0:04:27.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.51,0:04:30.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Captain or not, what gives you the right\Nto lord it over Stella like that, bud?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.97,0:04:33.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I dislike needless prattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.39,0:04:36.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Let us hurry and decide who will be frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.09,0:04:39.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,First, let's sort out what we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.51,0:04:41.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There are three Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.22,0:04:44.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,LeVi, are there any Engineers\Nor Doctors on board?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.72,0:04:45.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Affirmative.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:52.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There is one individual each with Engineer,{\i0}\N{\i1}Doctor, and Guardian Angel credentials.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.39,0:04:53.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,"Guardian Angel"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.97,0:04:55.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There's a role like that, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.97,0:05:02.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes. The Guardian Angel can protect one crew{\i0}\N{\i1}member of their choice from Gnosia attack.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.18,0:05:09.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is impossible for the Gnosia to attack a{\i0}\N{\i1}human protected in this way during warp.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.64,0:05:12.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, because this places a{\i0}\N{\i1}great burden on the ship's hardware,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.68,0:05:15.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}only one person can be protected per night.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.30,0:05:19.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Also, the Guardian Angel{\i0}\N{\i1}cannot protect themselves.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.47,0:05:21.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.97,0:05:26.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So if they can predict the human most likely\Nto be attacked by the Gnosia...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.64,0:05:29.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,They can prevent the number\Nof humans going down?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.51,0:05:31.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, that is correct.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.39,0:05:32.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:33.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now I understand...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.30,0:05:38.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the purpose of these Guardian{\i0}\N{\i1}Angel credentials I received.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.18,0:05:41.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So, who's the Guardian Angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.30,0:05:47.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It seems no one intends to step forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.51,0:05:51.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Of course not.\NThe risk would be far too great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.72,0:05:52.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.84,0:05:54.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Do you really not understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.68,0:05:57.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,They're able to protect others\Nbut not themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:06:02.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So if they reveal who they are,\Nthe Gnosia will simply eliminate them first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.72,0:06:03.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.97,0:06:08.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But if you're gonna bring that up, aren't the\NEngineer and Doctor facing the same risk?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.55,0:06:10.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yes, they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.47,0:06:11.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.55,0:06:14.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The Engineer and Doctor\Nare able to identify the Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.89,0:06:19.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If they don't share their findings and try to\Nsway the vote some way, there's no point.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.05,0:06:25.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So there's some merit in outing\Nthemselves despite the risks, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.26,0:06:28.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Man, this is getting complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.05,0:06:32.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Well, is anyone going to declare\Nthemselves as the Engineer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.59,0:06:35.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kukrushka!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.51,0:06:41.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Hm... Looks like Kukrushka is\Nsaying that she is the Engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.64,0:06:45.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So that means that Kukrushka\Nis one of the bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.55,0:06:48.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Because I should be the only\NEngineer on board this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.55,0:06:51.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What? You're the Engineer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.51,0:06:54.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yup. It's better if the Engineer tells\Neveryone they're the Engineer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.47,0:06:57.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Is there a Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.72,0:07:01.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Actually, I have Doctor credentials.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.34,0:07:04.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,How droll.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.68,0:07:07.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I declare myself the Doctor
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.14,0:07:10.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,and thereby declare Shigemichi\Nto be an impostor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.97,0:07:15.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Captain, Captain! There seem\Nto be two over here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.22,0:07:18.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And thus, chaos ensues.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.26,0:07:21.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- Who do you think is suspicious, Yuri?\N- Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.34,0:07:22.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.68,0:07:25.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I don't really know at this stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.97,0:07:29.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What I do know that is out of\Nthe four that stepped forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.34,0:07:32.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,two are real and two are Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.93,0:07:34.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.18,0:07:39.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So if we choose someone out of the four,\Nwe have a 50% chance of eliminating a Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.34,0:07:41.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.18,0:07:43.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But at the same time, we have a 50% chance
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.68,0:07:47.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,of losing someone who has the important\Nability to identify the Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.22,0:07:52.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So would it be better to choose someone\Noutside of those four, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:07:56.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The thing is, there are three Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.55,0:08:00.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So if two of them are among the\Nfour that declared their roles,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.47,0:08:03.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,that means in the remaining eight...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:04.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There's just one Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.01,0:08:07.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So if we choose one of the eight,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.30,0:08:11.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,we have a seven-out-of-eight chance\Nof sending a human to an icy fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.14,0:08:17.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah... With that in mind, should\Nwe really exclude these four?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.26,0:08:20.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It certainly is a difficult decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.22,0:08:23.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Well, let us start by freezing {\i1}someone{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.22,0:08:25.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm sure things will become clearer as we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.89,0:08:28.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,In that case, why don't you\Ngo ahead and freeze yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.09,0:08:31.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Silence, clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.72,0:08:32.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.22,0:08:37.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But I mean, Yuriko does have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.26,0:08:39.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You'll never get this many people to agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.84,0:08:44.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna say this knowing that\Nyou might not believe me, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.64,0:08:48.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Kukrushka is a Gnosia.\NThat's what my gut's telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.18,0:08:51.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And you're saying that you're not...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.89,0:08:55.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Of course. It's as obvious as can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.30,0:08:58.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I promise I'm not lying. Please believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.14,0:09:06.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's no use. Neither of them{\i0}\N{\i1}seem like they're lying.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.47,0:09:09.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But one of them must be!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:11.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Please vote for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.55,0:09:15.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,At this rate, we'll never\Ncome to an agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.09,0:09:20.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But thankfully, I am not an Engineer,\NDoctor, or Guardian Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.51,0:09:24.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Freezing me will not put\Nthe humans at a disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.26,0:09:27.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That is a wise decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.39,0:09:30.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Stella... But you don't have\Nto nominate yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.47,0:09:32.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm fine with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:37.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,My position is slightly different\Nfrom all of yours, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.97,0:09:46.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Originally, Stella was sent by the government
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.34,0:09:49.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,as a combat maid who would look after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.34,0:09:53.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There's always been something\Nmysterious about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.47,0:09:55.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,A combat maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.22,0:09:58.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is almost time for the warp.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:10:00.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everyone, please return to your rooms.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.47,0:10:03.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's that time already?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.80,0:10:05.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Kukrushka.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.22,0:10:13.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I will burn your beauty into my eyes\Nbefore sleep's gentle embrace claims me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.51,0:10:16.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,After all, who can say if any of us\Nwill live to see tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.89,0:10:27.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.30,0:10:33.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yuri, please do not think too much{\i0}\N{\i1}about what Jonas said.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.89,0:10:36.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,LeVi... Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.34,0:10:40.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Though once a hero of{\i0}\N{\i1}the space exploration era,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.26,0:10:42.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}he is now just a drifter through space.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.09,0:10:46.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Space Federation has{\i0}\N{\i1}officially designated him as insane.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.39,0:10:50.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Insane? So his saying that Stella\Nwas a combat maid was...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.89,0:10:53.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's best not to think too deeply about it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:11:00.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,"Who will you protect?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.01,0:11:05.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. I'm the Guardian Angel,\Nso I have to choose who to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.18,0:11:10.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who is the Gnosia most likely to attack first?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.30,0:11:16.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course, the Gnosia know who the{\i0}\N{\i1}real Doctor and Engineer are.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.18,0:11:21.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So the first one they'd want{\i0}\N{\i1}to eliminate is the real Engineer{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.80,0:11:23.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that can identify them.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.09,0:11:26.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if the Gnosia{\i0}\N{\i1}eliminate the real Engineer,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.97,0:11:30.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that's as good as confirming that the{\i0}\N{\i1}remaining Engineer is a Gnosia.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.39,0:11:34.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They'd be ensuring one of their own{\i0}\N{\i1}was sent to cold sleep the next day.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.76,0:11:37.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sure they can see at least that far ahead.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.39,0:11:38.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which means...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.76,0:11:41.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I guess I should choose someone{\i0}\N{\i1}who hasn't stepped forward.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.14,0:11:44.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There'd be a five-out-of-six{\i0}\N{\i1}chance they're human.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.39,0:11:47.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The odds that I'd mistakenly{\i0}\N{\i1}protect a Gnosia are low.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.05,0:11:50.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No... That's too simple.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.05,0:11:54.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't just choose the easiest answer.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.22,0:11:56.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You need to think like a Gnosia!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.47,0:11:59.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What choice would give{\i0}\N{\i1}them the biggest advantage?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.14,0:12:04.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For that matter, why would Gnosia step forward{\i0}\N{\i1}as Engineer or Doctor in the first place?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.34,0:12:09.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's true that their false reports would{\i0}\N{\i1}cause confusion among the humans,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.30,0:12:11.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but the longer they have to keep up the act,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.55,0:12:14.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the higher chance the humans have{\i0}\N{\i1}of seeing through their lies.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.55,0:12:17.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So why would they step forward,{\i0}\N{\i1}given all that?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:23.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Is it because... the Engineer and\NDoctor are that much of a threat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.59,0:12:29.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.97,0:12:32.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If only one person claims to be the Engineer,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.26,0:12:35.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it effectively confirms them{\i0}\N{\i1}as the real Engineer.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.14,0:12:38.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then the Guardian Angel just needs{\i0}\N{\i1}to continue protecting them,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.76,0:12:42.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and they're free to check one{\i0}\N{\i1}person at a time unhindered.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.72,0:12:48.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see. That's how big of{\i0}\N{\i1}a threat the Engineer is.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.84,0:12:53.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which means that even if it means{\i0}\N{\i1}risking one Gnosia being identified,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.22,0:12:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}there's still a possibility that they'll try{\i0}\N{\i1}to eliminate the real Engineer first.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.55,0:13:03.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I promise I'm not lying. Please believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.30,0:13:09.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You have made your choice.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.80,0:13:18.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Four, three, two, one...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.80,0:13:29.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.59,0:13:31.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.14,0:13:33.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.76,0:13:34.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.39,0:13:45.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,LeVi, could you check the crew's status?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.14,0:13:49.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Certainly. All personnel{\i0}\N{\i1}seem to be accounted for.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.51,0:13:51.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It appears as though no one was attacked.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.30,0:13:54.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Seriously? That's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.51,0:13:58.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The Guardian Angel predicted the human\Nthat the Gnosia were going to attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.68,0:14:00.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,successfully protecting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.51,0:14:05.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's quite the feat.\NThose were one-in-ten odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.09,0:14:10.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes! Yes!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.30,0:14:12.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I knew that Comet was lying.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.51,0:14:15.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kukrushka is the real Engineer.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.59,0:14:17.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Since no one was attacked,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.89,0:14:20.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that means that the human that{\i0}\N{\i1}the Guardian Angel protected{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:22.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}was the one the Gnosia tried to attack.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.34,0:14:25.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Gnosia only attack humans, which means...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.01,0:14:28.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kukrushka is the real Engineer.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.55,0:14:31.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That also confirms that Comet is a Gnosia.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.59,0:14:37.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now I just need to somehow convey{\i0}\N{\i1}this truth to everyone and sway the vote.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.26,0:14:45.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's start with the reports\Nfrom the Engineers and the Doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.43,0:14:47.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Alrighty! I'll go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.68,0:14:50.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Stella, who went into cold sleep, was human.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.89,0:14:53.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I can also report that Stella was human.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.97,0:14:57.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What a pointless person to freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.97,0:15:00.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I can't say that I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.05,0:15:02.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And from the Engineers?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:08.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Ah, so you're saying she's human.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.22,0:15:14.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kukrushka is the real Engineer,{\i0}\N{\i1}so what she says must be true.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.05,0:15:17.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which also means that Yuriko{\i0}\N{\i1}can be confirmed as human...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.84,0:15:20.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and Shigemichi as a Gnosia.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.64,0:15:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Wow...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.01,0:15:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}To think that confirming the Engineer{\i0}\N{\i1}could confirm so much else in turn.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.14,0:15:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}No wonder the Gnosia are so{\i0}\N{\i1}desperate to eliminate them.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.59,0:15:32.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Then I'll do my report next.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.34,0:15:34.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I checked out Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.30,0:15:37.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And Yuri's a Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.76,0:15:39.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't falter.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.34,0:15:43.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't panic and argue with her.{\i0}\N{\i1}That'll just put more suspicion on you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.93,0:15:46.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can already see the truth.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.22,0:15:50.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Could you tell me why you\Ndecided to check me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.97,0:15:53.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There was just something\Nreally suspicious about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.26,0:15:55.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Like you were trying\Nto lead us in a certain direction,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.47,0:15:58.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,talking about difficult things\Nlike odds and chances and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.76,0:16:01.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What they said made a lot of sense, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.72,0:16:04.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I don't think they were trying\Nto manipulate us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.26,0:16:06.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It just sounded like they were\Nassessing the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.68,0:16:09.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I feel we can trust Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.59,0:16:13.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm telling the truth, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.64,0:16:16.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I've had my eye on Yuri, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.26,0:16:17.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.72,0:16:20.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So this is how they sow doubt.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.64,0:16:21.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What should I do?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.84,0:16:24.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm the only one who can see the whole truth.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.22,0:16:26.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I misspeak, that'll cast{\i0}\N{\i1}more suspicion onto me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.14,0:16:29.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So, which is it, Sir Yurinchy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.93,0:16:34.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I am human. But Comet has\Ndeclared that I'm Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.80,0:16:38.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Which means one of us is lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.68,0:16:42.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt that either\NComet or myself is a Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.55,0:16:45.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So you're saying that we\Nshould vote for one of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.01,0:16:47.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.47,0:16:50.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,As long as there's a possibility\Nthat Comet is the real Engineer,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:52.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,it'd be too risky to freeze her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.89,0:16:54.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that put you at a disadvantage?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.55,0:16:57.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.89,0:16:59.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's true.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.43,0:17:01.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I'm sure that Comet will...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.22,0:17:04.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's fine, right... Comet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.64,0:17:07.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.51,0:17:10.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.72,0:17:12.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I want you all to believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.01,0:17:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm the real Engineer!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.80,0:17:23.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.72,0:17:26.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,N-No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.26,0:17:31.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You end up saying more than you{\i0}\N{\i1}need to when you're nervous.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.26,0:17:34.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And that's when your lies become easier{\i0}\N{\i1}to spot through your body language.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.76,0:17:35.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.43,0:18:00.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It has been decided.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.26,0:18:04.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Comet will be put into cold sleep.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.22,0:18:06.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just two more...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.18,0:18:10.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.59,0:18:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Who do I protect?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.43,0:18:19.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tomorrow, Yuriko will report as the Doctor{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.55,0:18:23.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that Comet, who was sent into{\i0}\N{\i1}cold sleep, was a Gnosia.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.26,0:18:26.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which will prove that{\i0}\N{\i1}Comet's report was a lie,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.51,0:18:29.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and then everyone will be able to see{\i0}\N{\i1}that I am human with their own eyes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.97,0:18:33.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At the same time, this will confirm{\i0}\N{\i1}that Comet was the fake Engineer{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.26,0:18:35.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and Kukrushka is the real one.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.76,0:18:40.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which then confirms that Yuriko, who{\i0}\N{\i1}she identified as human, is the real Doctor.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.64,0:18:44.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Gnosia are going to want to stop{\i0}\N{\i1}all that from falling into place.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.97,0:18:47.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which means, the one they'll{\i0}\N{\i1}want to eliminate is...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.09,0:18:56.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You want me to believe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:19:01.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see. She still thinks I might suspect her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.47,0:19:04.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course she does, since I'm the{\i0}\N{\i1}only one who can see the truth.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.93,0:19:09.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I haven't told anyone else,\Nbut I'll share this with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.18,0:19:15.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm the Guardian Angel.\NI protected you yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.64,0:19:19.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's why I know that\Nyou're the real Engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.05,0:19:22.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I also know that Comet\Nand Shigemichi are Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.43,0:19:30.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So I want you to check the remaining\Ncrew members and find the last Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.01,0:19:36.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'll continue protecting you\Nas the Guardian Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.18,0:19:42.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.97,0:19:53.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Three, two...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.64,0:20:01.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So Setsu was...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.89,0:20:05.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Affirmative. I do not sense Setsu's presence.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.39,0:20:08.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I guess they predicted that{\i0}\N{\i1}I would protect Kukrushka.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.05,0:20:13.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But as long as Kukrushka remains,{\i0}\N{\i1}we'll be able to find the other Gnosia.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.59,0:20:15.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Racio...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.51,0:20:19.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't tell me...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.64,0:20:23.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.55,0:20:25.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.64,0:20:29.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So Racio is the other Gnosia!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.47,0:20:32.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,How long do you plan to make us wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.68,0:20:34.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Commence the banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.68,0:20:40.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Man, there's still nine of us left.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.59,0:20:46.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Calm down. Now I know for sure{\i0}\N{\i1}who all three Gnosia are.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:49.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All that's left is to get them sent{\i0}\N{\i1}into cold sleep during the meeting.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.93,0:20:53.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,First, let's lay out all the facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.97,0:20:57.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yesterday, we sent Comet into cold sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.84,0:21:00.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If Comet was a Gnosia,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.39,0:21:03.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,that would mean that Kukrushka\Nis the real Engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.34,0:21:08.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The Doctors have already checked, right?\NIf Comet was a Gnosia or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.64,0:21:11.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yes. Comet was a Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.14,0:21:13.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Nope! Comet was human!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.89,0:21:17.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh? It seems the verdict has been split.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.68,0:21:21.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The most important thing to establish\Nis which one is the real Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.01,0:21:25.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You speak as though you know the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.64,0:21:26.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.76,0:21:27.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.97,0:21:31.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Kukrushka reported Yuriko as human yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.01,0:21:36.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,As she was confirmed by Kukrushka,\Nthe real Engineer, Yuriko's reports are also—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.55,0:21:38.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Kukrushka is the real Engineer?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.47,0:21:41.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Hah! And when was {\i1}that{\i0} confirmed, pray tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.51,0:21:43.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.47,0:21:50.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Good point. The other Doctor, Shigemichi,\Nsaid that Comet was human.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.22,0:21:53.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shoot. That's right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.51,0:21:56.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The others have no way of confirming{\i0}\N{\i1}that Kukrushka is the real Engineer!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.80,0:22:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I can only confirm it because I'm the Guardian{\i0}\N{\i1}Angel and succeeded in protecting her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.64,0:22:05.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which means I'm going to have{\i0}\N{\i1}to explain that to the others.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.51,0:22:09.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, but that would mean outing myself{\i0}\N{\i1}as the Guardian Angel...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.43,0:22:14.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to come out and\Nsay that I'm the Guardian Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.80,0:22:17.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.30,0:22:19.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.47,0:22:23.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What should I do? Should I come out{\i0}\N{\i1}and say that I'm the real one?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.93,0:22:26.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But what if this is a trap?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.97,0:22:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}No... I can't think of{\i0}\N{\i1}the answer quick enough!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.51,0:22:33.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,On the first day, I protected Comet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:38.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Though due to baseless accusations,\Nshe was frozen the very next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.43,0:22:39.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.01,0:22:43.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That day, the Guardian Angel\Nprotected Kukrushka.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.47,0:22:46.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The real Engineer is Kukrushka!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.51,0:22:49.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh? And how do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.89,0:22:53.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Because... I'm the real Guardian Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.22,0:22:58.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Looks like we've lured out the final Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.01,0:23:00.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Now, let me ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.05,0:23:04.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.34,0:23:07.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,why were you secretly\Nmeeting with Kukrushka?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.51,0:23:09.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Kukrushka...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.05,0:23:13.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You let your guard down, knowing your\Nconversation wouldn't be recorded.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.55,0:23:18.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You need to make sure you're not seen by\Nanyone for a secret meeting to be secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.47,0:23:24.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,N-No! This is all backwards!\NI'm the real Guardian Angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.43,0:23:26.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You seem to be panicking quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.05,0:23:28.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You'd do well to be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.30,0:23:31.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If you panic while defending yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.89,0:23:33.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Everyone will think you're suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.68,0:23:47.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I figured it all out...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.80,0:23:53.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.51,0:23:54.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.84,0:23:57.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Next time...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.09,0:23:59.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Next time...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.34,0:24:23.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,A dolphin...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.05,0:24:28.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,A-A dolphin?!

